  {
   "id": "ex2",
   "type": "example",
   "problem": {
    "en": "f : R − {3} → R − {1}, f(x) = (x − 2)/(x − 3). Find f⁻¹."
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "y = (x − 2)/(x − 3) ⇒ yx − 3y = x − 2."
    },
    {
     "en": "x(y − 1) = 3y − 2 ⇒ x = (3y − 2)/(y − 1)."
    },
    {
     "en": "This is defined for every y ≠ 1, so f is onto and invertible."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "f⁻¹(y) = (3y − 2)/(y − 1)"
   },
   "narration": {
    "en": "Let us solve this together. f : R − {3} → R − {1}, f(x) = (x − 2)/(x − 3). Find f⁻¹."
   }
