   "body": {
    "en": "For f(x) = ax + b, undo the steps in reverse order: subtract b, then divide by a. So f⁻¹(x) = (x − b)/a. For (ax + b)/(cx + d), the inverse is (dx − b)/(−cx + a): swap a and d, change the signs of b and c."
   },
